{"seq":2,"slug":"asset-version-rights-license","title":"版本/版权/授权有效期管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketing-creative-dam-aigc-production/creative-dam-model/asset-version-rights-license","wordCount":2290,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"版本-版权-授权有效期管理\">版本/版权/授权有效期管理</h1><p>素材库里最贵的一类错误不是丢失，而是&quot;用错了版本&quot;和&quot;用了过期的授权&quot;。前者让已经修掉的合规问题重新出现在广告里，后者让一次投放变成一次侵权索赔。这两类错误有共同特征：它们都不是在写入时暴露的，而是在素材离库、进入某个市场的那一刻才暴露。因此版本与授权的管理核心不是存储，而是<strong>在读取路径上做校验</strong>。这一节给出这两条状态链的建模方式与校验点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-两条独立的状态链\">核心概念：两条独立的状态链</h2><p>版本和授权是两条正交的状态链。版本回答&quot;这份内容改到第几版了&quot;，授权回答&quot;这份内容在哪些地方、什么时间范围内可以用&quot;。它们独立变化：一次修图产生新版本但不改授权；一次续约更新授权但不产生新版本。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  subgraph VersionChain[&quot;版本链(内容维度)&quot;]&#10;    V0[&quot;draft&quot;] --&gt; V1[&quot;in_review&quot;]&#10;    V1 --&gt; V2[&quot;approved&quot;]&#10;    V1 --&gt; V3[&quot;rejected&quot;]&#10;    V2 --&gt; V4[&quot;superseded&quot;]&#10;  end&#10;  subgraph RightsChain[&quot;授权链(权限维度)&quot;]&#10;    R0[&quot;pending&quot;] --&gt; R1[&quot;active&quot;]&#10;    R1 --&gt; R2[&quot;expiring&quot;]&#10;    R1 --&gt; R3[&quot;expired&quot;]&#10;    R1 --&gt; R4[&quot;revoked&quot;]&#10;  end&#10;  V2 --&gt;|可投放的必要条件| R1&#10;  V4 -.-&gt;|历史素材仅可读取| R3\">graph TD\n  subgraph VersionChain[\"版本链(内容维度)\"]\n    V0[\"draft\"] --&gt; V1[\"in_review\"]\n    V1 --&gt; V2[\"approved\"]\n    V1 --&gt; V3[\"rejected\"]\n    V2 --&gt; V4[\"superseded\"]\n  end\n  subgraph RightsChain[\"授权链(权限维度)\"]\n    R0[\"pending\"] --&gt; R1[\"active\"]\n    R1 --&gt; R2[\"expiring\"]\n    R1 --&gt; R3[\"expired\"]\n    R1 --&gt; R4[\"revoked\"]\n  end\n  V2 --&gt;|可投放的必要条件| R1\n  V4 -.-&gt;|历史素材仅可读取| R3</pre><p>关键约束是：<strong>可投放 = 版本状态为 approved 且授权状态为 active 且当前时间落在授权窗口内</strong>。三个条件缺一不可，而且必须在一个查询里判断完，不能分两步（先查版本再查授权），否则两步之间会发生状态变更，产生&quot;校验通过但实际不可投放&quot;的窗口。</p>\n<p>两条链的驱动方式与失效范围差别很大，这决定了它们必须分开建模：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>版本链</th>\n<th>授权链</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>状态迁移驱动</td>\n<td>人工审批动作</td>\n<td>时间到期 + 人工撤销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>迁移频率</td>\n<td>低（每资产每月数次）</td>\n<td>到期批量扫描，每日一次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>失效影响范围</td>\n<td>单个资产的单个版本</td>\n<td>可能一次覆盖上千个资产</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>历史数据是否需要可读</td>\n<td>是（superseded 版本仍可查看）</td>\n<td>是（revoked 记录需留痕审计）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>谁能修改</td>\n<td>品牌/法务审批人</td>\n<td>法务 + 版权系统同步</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是否可撤销</td>\n<td>不可（只能新建版本）</td>\n<td>可（revoked 是终态但可要求下架）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"为什么不做状态合并\">为什么不做状态合并</h3><p>一个自然的简化想法是把两条链合并成一个 <code>usable</code> 状态。这会在两个场景下失效。第一，授权到期是一个<strong>时间驱动</strong>的迁移，不需要任何人操作；版本审批是<strong>人驱动</strong>的。把两者合进一个状态机，会让&quot;到期扫描任务&quot;和&quot;人工审批动作&quot;争抢同一行的写权限。第二，授权撤销可能同时影响成百上千个版本（一次版权纠纷导致某个摄影师的所有素材下架），而版本状态必须逐个处理。分开建模让批量失效成为一条 <code>UPDATE rights_record SET status=&#39;revoked&#39;</code> 加上读路径的即时校验，而不需要触碰任何版本行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"版本链的实现\">版本链的实现</h2><h3 id=\"版本号与派生关系\">版本号与派生关系</h3><p>版本号必须是单调递增的整数，不能用时间戳——批量生成场景下几十个版本可能在同一秒内落库。<code>(asset_id, version_no)</code> 是主键，<code>current_version_id</code> 是资产表上的指针。当新版本被批准时，旧版本的 approved 状态迁移为 <code>superseded</code>，这个迁移必须与新版本的批准在同一事务内：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"BEGIN;&#10;UPDATE asset_version&#10;   SET status = &#39;superseded&#39;&#10; WHERE asset_id = :asset_id AND status = &#39;approved&#39; AND version_id &lt;&gt; :new_version_id;&#10;&#10;UPDATE asset_version SET status = &#39;approved&#39;, approved_at = now()&#10; WHERE version_id = :new_version_id AND status = &#39;in_review&#39;;&#10;&#10;UPDATE asset SET current_version_id = :new_version_id, updated_at = now()&#10; WHERE asset_id = :asset_id;&#10;COMMIT;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BEGIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asset_version</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   SET</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'superseded'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asset_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :asset_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'approved'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> version_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :new_version_id;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asset_version </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'approved'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, approved_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> version_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :new_version_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'in_review'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asset </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current_version_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :new_version_id, updated_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asset_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :asset_id;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">COMMIT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>第一条语句的 <code>AND version_id &lt;&gt; :new_version_id</code> 不是冗余——如果同一版本被重复批准（重试请求），不加这个条件会把自己的 approved 改成 superseded。</p>\n<h3 id=\"派生件的血缘\">派生件的血缘</h3><p>修图产生的版本与原版本之间是<strong>派生关系</strong>而非替换关系：原版本的授权、模特肖像许可、拍摄场景可能仍然约束新版本（比如模特许可只覆盖原始拍摄的画面构图，裁切放大后可能超出范围）。因此版本表需要记录 <code>derived_from_version_id</code>，并在授权校验时沿血缘向上追溯所有祖先版本的授权约束，取交集。</p>\n<p>追溯深度在实践中通常不超过三层，可以直接用递归 CTE：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"WITH RECURSIVE lineage AS (&#10;  SELECT version_id, derived_from_version_id, 0 AS depth&#10;    FROM asset_version WHERE version_id = :version_id&#10;  UNION ALL&#10;  SELECT v.version_id, v.derived_from_version_id, l.depth + 1&#10;    FROM asset_version v JOIN lineage l ON v.version_id = l.derived_from_version_id&#10;   WHERE l.depth &lt; 5&#10;)&#10;SELECT r.* FROM rights_record r&#10; WHERE r.version_id IN (SELECT version_id FROM lineage) AND r.status &lt;&gt; &#39;revoked&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> RECURSIVE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lineage </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> version_id, derived_from_version_id, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> depth</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asset_version </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> version_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :version_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNION ALL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">version_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">derived_from_version_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">depth</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asset_version v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lineage l </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">version_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">derived_from_version_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">depth</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rights_record r</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">version_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> version_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lineage) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'revoked'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>depth &lt; 5</code> 是防御性的深度上限，防止数据异常时无限递归打满数据库。</p>\n<h2 id=\"授权链的实现\">授权链的实现</h2><h3 id=\"授权记录的数据形状\">授权记录的数据形状</h3><p>一条授权记录需要表达四件事：<strong>授权方</strong>（谁给的权）、<strong>范围</strong>（哪些市场、哪些渠道、哪些用途）、<strong>时间窗口</strong>（起止）、<strong>限制条件</strong>（是否可二次编辑、是否需署名、是否含模特肖像）。把这些塞进一个 JSON 列会在校验时失去索引能力，因此范围与时间做成独立列，限制条件做成 JSON。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE rights_record (&#10;  rights_id     bigserial PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  asset_id      bigint NOT NULL REFERENCES asset(asset_id),&#10;  version_id    bigint REFERENCES asset_version(version_id),&#10;  licensor      text   NOT NULL,&#10;  license_type  text   NOT NULL CHECK (license_type IN&#10;                  (&#39;owned&#39;,&#39;exclusive&#39;,&#39;non-exclusive&#39;,&#39;editorial&#39;,&#39;ugc-granted&#39;)),&#10;  markets       text[] NOT NULL,&#10;  channels      text[] NOT NULL,&#10;  valid_from    timestamptz NOT NULL,&#10;  valid_until   timestamptz,&#10;  requires_credit     boolean NOT NULL DEFAULT false,&#10;  credit_text         text,&#10;  model_release_ref   text,&#10;  constraints   jsonb NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;{}&#39;::jsonb,&#10;  status        text NOT NULL CHECK (status IN&#10;                  (&#39;pending&#39;,&#39;active&#39;,&#39;expiring&#39;,&#39;expired&#39;,&#39;revoked&#39;)),&#10;  revoked_reason text&#10;);&#10;CREATE INDEX rights_active_expiry ON rights_record (status, valid_until)&#10;  WHERE status IN (&#39;active&#39;,&#39;expiring&#39;);&#10;CREATE INDEX rights_by_market ON rights_record USING gin (markets);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> rights_record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rights_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigserial</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  asset_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asset(asset_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  version_id    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asset_version(version_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  licensor      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  license_type  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (license_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                  (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'owned'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'exclusive'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'non-exclusive'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'editorial'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ugc-granted'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  markets       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  channels      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  valid_from    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  valid_until   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  requires_credit     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">boolean</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> false,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  credit_text         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  model_release_ref   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  constraints   jsonb </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::jsonb,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                  (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'pending'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'active'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'expiring'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'expired'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'revoked'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  revoked_reason </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> rights_active_expiry</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rights_record (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, valid_until)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'active'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'expiring'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> rights_by_market</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rights_record </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gin (markets);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>valid_until</code> 允许为 NULL 表达永久授权（自有素材）。<code>markets</code> 用 GIN 索引以支持 <code>@&gt;</code> 包含查询。<code>channels</code> 不建 GIN 索引，因为渠道维度的过滤通常跟在市场过滤之后，候选集已经很小。</p>\n<h3 id=\"到期状态如何维护\">到期状态如何维护</h3><p><code>expiring</code> 与 <code>expired</code> 这两个状态由定时任务维护，而不是在读路径实时计算。原因是&quot;还有 30 天到期&quot;这类阈值需要主动通知运营去续约，实时计算无法触发通知。任务的职责是把 <code>valid_until</code> 与当前时间比较并批量迁移状态：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"UPDATE rights_record&#10;   SET status = CASE&#10;         WHEN valid_until &lt;= now()                      THEN &#39;expired&#39;&#10;         WHEN valid_until &lt;= now() + interval &#39;30 days&#39; THEN &#39;expiring&#39;&#10;         ELSE &#39;active&#39; END&#10; WHERE status IN (&#39;active&#39;,&#39;expiring&#39;,&#39;expired&#39;)&#10;   AND valid_until IS NOT NULL&#10;   AND status &lt;&gt; CASE&#10;         WHEN valid_until &lt;= now()                      THEN &#39;expired&#39;&#10;         WHEN valid_until &lt;= now() + interval &#39;30 days&#39; THEN &#39;expiring&#39;&#10;         ELSE &#39;active&#39; END;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rights_record</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   SET</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CASE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> valid_until </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()                      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'expired'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> valid_until </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interval </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'30 days'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'expiring'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'active'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'active'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'expiring'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'expired'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> valid_until </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CASE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> valid_until </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()                      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'expired'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> valid_until </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interval </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'30 days'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'expiring'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'active'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>WHERE</code> 里的重复 CASE 是为了只更新真正发生迁移的行，避免每次全表重写。这个任务应当幂等且可重复运行——它读的是当前时间，重跑不会产生额外副作用。</p>\n<h3 id=\"读路径的校验为什么不能免\">读路径的校验为什么不能免</h3><p>既然状态已经被任务维护好了，读路径是否可以只信任 <code>status</code>？不能，有两个理由。第一，任务有运行间隔（通常每天一次），两次运行之间会有授权刚过期的窗口，这个窗口内的投放是侵权的。第二，投放渠道的时区与库的时区可能不同。因此最终校验必须同时判断状态与时间：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT 1 FROM rights_record&#10; WHERE asset_id = :asset_id&#10;   AND status = &#39;active&#39;&#10;   AND valid_from &lt;= now()&#10;   AND (valid_until IS NULL OR valid_until &gt; now())&#10;   AND markets @&gt; ARRAY[:market]&#10;   AND channels @&gt; ARRAY[:channel];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rights_record</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asset_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :asset_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'active'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> valid_from </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (valid_until </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> OR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> valid_until </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> markets @</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ARRAY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[:market]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> channels @</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ARRAY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[:channel];</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>status = &#39;active&#39;</code> 排除了 <code>expiring</code>——这是有意的保守选择：临期授权不允许新投放，但允许已投放素材继续跑到自然结束。两者的差别在 <a href=\"asset-publish-channel-distribute\">审批后多渠道分发</a> 的撤回逻辑里会用到。</p>\n<h2 id=\"署名与限制条件的落地\">署名与限制条件的落地</h2><p><code>requires_credit</code> 与 <code>credit_text</code> 是两条容易被忽略但后果严重的字段。署名义务在图片类素材上有成熟的外部标准可对齐：IPTC 的 Credit Line 与 Copyright Notice 分别承载&quot;署名给谁&quot;和&quot;版权归谁&quot;，Web Statement of Rights 承载&quot;完整的权利声明在哪&quot; <a href=\"http://iptc.org/std/photometadata/specification/IPTC-PhotoMetadata-2025.1.html\">IPTC Photo Metadata Standard 2025.1</a>。素材导出时这些字段应当写入文件的 XMP 元数据，而不是只留在库里——XMP 的定位就是让元数据跟随文件本身跨应用流转，它自 2012 年起是 ISO 16684-1 标准 <a href=\"https://developer.adobe.com/xmp/docs/\">Adobe XMP</a>。</p>\n<p>当素材投影到网页展示时，对应的承载属性是 schema.org 的 <code>creditText</code> 与 <code>copyrightNotice</code>，以及指向完整许可文本的 <code>license</code> <a href=\"https://schema.org/ImageObject\">schema.org ImageObject</a>。三个字段的语义不要混用：<code>license</code> 指向许可条款文档，<code>copyrightNotice</code> 是短声明（如&quot;© 2026 某某公司&quot;），<code>creditText</code> 是展示型署名（如&quot;摄影：某某&quot;）。</p>\n<p>如果素材经过生成式模型编辑，还需要在授权校验里检查 AI 相关字段。欧盟 AI 法案第 50 条要求生成合成音频、图像、视频或文本的系统提供方以机器可读格式标记输出，使其可被检测为人工生成或操纵，这一义务自 2026 年 8 月 2 日起适用 <a href=\"https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/50/\">EU AI Act Article 50</a>。工程上的落点是：<code>rights_record.constraints</code> 里记录该版本是否含 AI 生成成分，一旦为真，分发环节必须同时写入来源标记，否则放行失败。</p>\n<h2 id=\"到期风险的前置暴露\">到期风险的前置暴露</h2><p>授权管理最有价值的部分不是拦截，而是<strong>提前暴露</strong>。运营在策划一次投放时，应当能在选素材的阶段就看到哪些素材的授权会在投放周期内过期。工程手段是把&quot;投放计划的时间窗口&quot;作为查询参数传入素材检索：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION search_usable(&#10;  p_market text, p_channel text, p_from timestamptz, p_to timestamptz&#10;) RETURNS TABLE (asset_id bigint, risk text) LANGUAGE sql STABLE AS $$&#10;  SELECT a.asset_id,&#10;         CASE WHEN r.valid_until IS NULL OR r.valid_until &gt;= p_to&#10;              THEN &#39;safe&#39; ELSE &#39;expires_in_window&#39; END&#10;    FROM asset a&#10;    JOIN asset_version v ON v.version_id = a.current_version_id&#10;    JOIN rights_record  r ON r.asset_id = a.asset_id&#10;   WHERE v.status = &#39;approved&#39; AND r.status = &#39;active&#39;&#10;     AND r.valid_from &lt;= p_from&#10;     AND r.valid_until IS NULL OR r.valid_until &gt; p_from&#10;     AND r.markets @&gt; ARRAY[p_market] AND r.channels @&gt; ARRAY[p_channel];&#10;$$;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE OR REPLACE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FUNCTION</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> search_usable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  p_market </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, p_channel </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, p_from </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, p_to </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">RETURNS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (asset_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, risk </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LANGUAGE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> sql</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> STABLE </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $$</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">asset_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">valid_until</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> OR</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">valid_until</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p_to</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">              THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'safe'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'expires_in_window'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asset a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asset_version v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">version_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">current_version_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rights_record  r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">asset_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">asset_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'approved'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'active'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">valid_from</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p_from</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">valid_until</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> OR</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">valid_until</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p_from</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">markets</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> @</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ARRAY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[p_market] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">channels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> @</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ARRAY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[p_channel];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$$;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>返回 <code>expires_in_window</code> 的素材不是不可用，而是需要运营做一次显式确认（&quot;我知道它会在投放中期过期，我接受&quot;）。把风险变成一次点击确认，比在投放当天被系统拒绝要好得多。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>版本与授权是两条独立状态链，可投放需同时满足 approved、active 与当前时间在窗口内。</li>\n<li>不做状态合并，因为一条由时间驱动、一条由人驱动，且授权撤销需要批量生效。</li>\n<li>版本号用单调整数，<code>current_version_id</code> 用复合外键约束保证指针不悬空。</li>\n<li>派生版本需要血缘追溯，授权约束沿血缘取交集，递归深度设上限。</li>\n<li>到期状态由幂等定时任务维护并触发续约通知，但读路径仍必须同时校验状态与时间。</li>\n<li>署名与版权信息对齐 IPTC 字段并写入 XMP；AI 生成物需额外标记以满足机器可读披露要求。</li>\n<li>把&quot;投放窗口内是否过期&quot;作为检索维度前置暴露，让风险成为一次显式确认。</li>\n<li>标签与检索的基础模型见 <a href=\"creative-asset-library-tag\">素材库模型与多维标签</a>；授权通过后如何分渠道推送见 <a href=\"asset-publish-channel-distribute\">审批后多渠道分发</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"版本/版权/授权有效期管理","id":"版本-版权-授权有效期管理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：两条独立的状态链","id":"核心概念-两条独立的状态链"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么不做状态合并","id":"为什么不做状态合并"},{"level":2,"text":"版本链的实现","id":"版本链的实现"},{"level":3,"text":"版本号与派生关系","id":"版本号与派生关系"},{"level":3,"text":"派生件的血缘","id":"派生件的血缘"},{"level":2,"text":"授权链的实现","id":"授权链的实现"},{"level":3,"text":"授权记录的数据形状","id":"授权记录的数据形状"},{"level":3,"text":"到期状态如何维护","id":"到期状态如何维护"},{"level":3,"text":"读路径的校验为什么不能免","id":"读路径的校验为什么不能免"},{"level":2,"text":"署名与限制条件的落地","id":"署名与限制条件的落地"},{"level":2,"text":"到期风险的前置暴露","id":"到期风险的前置暴露"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"素材库模型与多维标签","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketing-creative-dam-aigc-production/creative-dam-model/creative-asset-library-tag"},"next":{"title":"按市场×渠道的素材复用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketing-creative-dam-aigc-production/creative-dam-model/market-channel-asset-reuse"}}